  "rationale": "A has the most precise and complete technical treatment, especially of drag interruption, coordinate spaces and the 'vetted out' claims. Its plans are fully self-contained, and it labels every runtime claim as unverified. B is a close second with cleaner Reduced Motion sections but shallower drag analysis. C loses points mainly because it keeps palette animation for keyboard users and gives less detail in its drag plan.",
